{"h":3396,"lines":[{"x":0.82510288143950483,"w":0.084362138112386131,"h":0.017441860778592999,"t":"Reading","c":1,"y":0.036337209119160163},{"y":0.079811676943350895,"c":1,"w":0.17741597493489583,"h":0.016993756850279707,"t":"Questions 33-35","x":0.069708280091136221},{"w":0.370632807413737,"x":0.06777389503953174,"h":0.019556638630034651,"t":"Choose the correct letter, A, B, C or D.","y":0.11621825072889547,"c":1},{"y":0.1510717747077821,"w":0.57644424438476571,"t":"Write the correct letter in boxes 33-35 on your answer sheet.","x":0.067747903727253575,"h":0.020000805983975911,"c":1},{"w":0.40329218546549478,"y":0.18749999983689603,"t":"33 What is the writer doing in Section A?","x":0.065843619054222036,"c":1,"h":0.017446996466431108},{"w":0.31069959004720049,"y":0.21511627883726636,"h":0.016038020171040834,"c":1,"t":"providing a solution to a concern","x":0.15843621191512861},{"h":0.013081395583944722,"c":1,"w":0.016460905075073251,"t":"B","x":0.11316872429373911,"y":0.23255813928651603},{"h":0.013081395583944722,"x":0.11111111136144317,"w":0.018518517812093099,"c":1,"t":"C","y":0.25145348816110069},{"t":"D","c":1,"y":0.268895348626217,"x":0.11111111136144317,"h":0.013081395583944722,"w":0.018518517812093099},{"w":0.33979911804199214,"h":0.019178363543938426,"t":"justifying an opinion about an issue","c":1,"y":0.23233391863312169,"x":0.15623308189396803},{"t":"highlighting the existence of a problem","x":0.15843621275172373,"h":0.01598837238037687,"y":0.25145348822221913,"c":1,"w":0.3683127593994141},{"t":"explaining the reasons for a phenomenon","y":0.26855642547363212,"c":1,"w":0.39536234537760417,"x":0.15828361562145518,"h":0.018507276743966239},{"h":0.02286228049629857,"t":"34 According to Section C, why might some people be reluctant to accept Al?","w":0.7513295491536458,"x":0.063623617179784916,"c":1,"y":0.30226366011387951},{"t":"They are afraid it will replace humans in decision-making jobs.","y":0.32919063342621302,"w":0.61140085856119786,"c":1,"h":0.021426276127216481,"x":0.13978886371627464},{"t":"Its complexity makes them feel that they are at a disadvantage.","y":0.34857531589520563,"w":0.60320622762044274,"c":1,"h":0.020503319334787218,"x":0.15621794954978421},{"t":"They would rather wait for the technology to be tested over a period of time.","x":0.15626759152899675,"w":0.72041081746419278,"h":0.020339815299277753,"y":0.36633208261163941,"c":1},{"t":"Misunderstandings about how it works make it seem more challenging","h":0.02142412839424479,"x":0.15826706832368767,"c":1,"w":0.66497248331705727,"y":0.38290162871808509},{"w":0.091513595581054707,"x":0.15603166487562531,"y":0.40161182817578767,"h":0.015729706475535288,"c":1,"t":"than it is."},{"h":0.018901454265041751,"x":0.063685459091161453,"c":1,"t":"35 What does the writer say about the media in Section C of the text?","y":0.43726396754128061,"w":0.67712346394856771},{"t":"It leads the public to be mistrustful of Al.","y":0.46478290838053038,"w":0.38305763244628899,"x":0.15621755479884133,"h":0.019335839998315008,"c":1},{"h":0.013081395583944722,"t":"B","y":0.48255813928651603,"w":0.018518517812093113,"c":1,"x":0.10905349819271885},{"c":1,"t":"It devotes an excessive amount of attention to Al.","y":0.48104214015705182,"x":0.15618080564029299,"w":0.47160402933756507,"h":0.01949188425627979},{"w":0.5308642069498698,"t":"Its reports of incidents involving Al are often inaccurate.","x":0.15432098277402284,"c":1,"y":0.50145348820965474,"h":0.017441860778592888},{"h":0.020917402701046472,"x":0.15416490182938256,"t":"It gives the impression that Al failures are due to designer error.","y":0.51749165218384541,"w":0.60733505249023434,"c":1},{"y":0.91133720911936489,"c":1,"w":0.026748971939086874,"t":"93","x":0.87242798305309033,"h":0.013081395583944611},{"y":0.95619871442209903,"c":1,"x":0.71930827958083488,"t":"IELTSXpress.com","w":0.25052792867024742,"h":0.02767260251533854}],"w":2400}